# AWS Infrastructure Automation with Terraform & Ansible

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates AWS infrastructure automation using *Terraform* and server configuration using *Ansible*.

Terraform is used to provision the AWS networking infrastructure and EC2 instance, while Ansible is used to configure the server and deploy an Nginx web application.

## Technologies Used

- AWS
- Terraform
- Ansible
- Amazon EC2
- Amazon VPC
- Ubuntu Linux
- Nginx
- Git & GitHub

## Architecture

```text
Internet
   |
Internet Gateway
   |
AWS VPC
   |
Public Subnet
   |
Security Group
   |
EC2 Instance
   |
Ansible
   |
Nginx Web Server
